@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Sign in as the development Auditor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auditor@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe-Dev-2026!",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### Search the read-only audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?fromDate=2026-10-19&toDate=2026-11-17&page=1&pageSize=25

### Filter audit entries by record type and search text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?entityType=attendance_record&search=late&page=1&pageSize=25

### Generate a read-only attendance compliance report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/reports?fromDate=2026-10-19&toDate=2026-11-17
